         port: same token values, PLUS mapping onto WinUI theme resources
         (ControlFillColor*, AccentFillColor*, ToggleSwitch*, ...) so stock WinUI
         templates render the macOS look without retemplating.
         ThemeDictionaries resolve per OS/app theme. Self-sufficient: merged at
         EmulatorPage level (ms-appx:///iCemDataMonitor.Emulator.WinUI/ThemeResources.xaml)
         вЂ” works in ANY host without a theme contract. в•ђв•ђв•ђ -->

